<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-105.2-dynamic-discounting-and-early-payment-operations" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3385" name="W3385. Dynamic-Discounting Platform Setup, Discount-Curve Design &amp; Vendor Enrollment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: SCF program launch (links to W3377); annual curve refresh
Frequency: Annual + periodic
Volume: ~200–500 vendors; ~8,500–9,500 monthly AP invoices (per profile §10.2)
Owner: Treasury Manager
Participants: Treasury Manager, AP Manager, Procurement, Vendor (links to VS-03.4), IT (links to VS-27.2)
Source: workflow W3385 — Dynamic-Discounting Platform Setup, Discount-Curve Design &amp; Vendor Enrollment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3385_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3385_Lane1" name="Treasury Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3385_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3385_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3385_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3385_Lane2" name="Procurement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3385_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3385_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3385_Start4" name="SCF program launch (links to W3377); annual curve refresh">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3385_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3385_Task5" name="Treasury Manager design the dynamic-discounting curve: discount % as a function…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Treasury Manager design the dynamic-discounting curve: discount % as a function of days-early (e.g., 2%/10, 1%/20, 0.5%/30 vs Net 45 standard), calibrated to BuildRight&#x27;s cost of funds (links to VS-18.3/W319), vendor margin tolerance (links to VS-39), and the risk-free alternative (links to VS-18 short-term investment yield W318)
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3385_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3385_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3385_Task6" name="Treasury/IT configure the dynamic-discounting module on the AP/SCF platform…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Treasury/IT configure the dynamic-discounting module on the AP/SCF platform: approved-payable feed (links to VS-15.1), curve engine, vendor enrollment flag, payment-method/routing, and GL mapping for discount income (links to VS-17.1); integrate and test end-to-end
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager / IT
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: Per setup</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3385_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3385_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3385_Task7" name="Procurement enroll vendors into dynamic discounting via the supplier portal…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Procurement enroll vendors into dynamic discounting via the supplier portal (links to VS-03.4): explain the sliding-scale offer, opt-in, set floor/ceiling, and confirm bank account; segment vendors by discount sensitivity and prioritize high-yield targets
Responsible (R): Procurement / Vendor
Accountable (A): Procurement Director
Duration: Wave-based</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3385_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3385_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3385_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3385_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-545 (ensure controlled execution — Dynamic Discounting &amp; Early-Payment Operations (PA-105.2).) | - operational: annual calibration to cost-of-funds and analytics (W3388); operational: IT testing and reconciliation (W3392)
Owner: Treasury Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3385_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3385_Annotation9" targetRef="W3385_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3385_Flow11" sourceRef="W3385_Start4" targetRef="W3385_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3385_Flow12" sourceRef="W3385_Task5" targetRef="W3385_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3385_Flow13" sourceRef="W3385_Task6" targetRef="W3385_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3385_Flow14" sourceRef="W3385_Task7" targetRef="W3385_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3385_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W3385_plane" bpmnElement="W_W3385">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3385_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W3385_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3385_Lane2_di" bpmnElement="W3385_Lane2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="250" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3385_Task5_di" bpmnElement="W3385_Task5"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3385_Task6_di" bpmnElement="W3385_Task6"><dc:Bounds x="610" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3385_Task7_di" bpmnElement="W3385_Task7"><dc:Bounds x="820" y="295" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3385_Start4_di" bpmnElement="W3385_Start4"><dc:Bounds x="290" y="147" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3385_End8_di" bpmnElement="W3385_End8"><dc:Bounds x="1050" y="317" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3385_Annotation9_di" bpmnElement="W3385_Annotation9"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="460" width="360" height="72" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3385_Flow11_di" bpmnElement="W3385_Flow11"><di:waypoint x="326" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="400" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3385_Flow12_di" bpmnElement="W3385_Flow12"><di:waypoint x="580" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="610" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3385_Flow13_di" bpmnElement="W3385_Flow13"><di:waypoint x="790" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="820" y="335" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3385_Flow14_di" bpmnElement="W3385_Flow14"><di:waypoint x="1000" y="335" /><di:waypoint x="1050" y="335" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3385_Assoc10_di" bpmnElement="W3385_Assoc10"><di:waypoint x="340" y="460" /><di:waypoint x="308" y="183" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3386" name="W3386. Sliding-Scale Early-Payment Offer Generation &amp; Vendor Acceptance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Invoice approval (links to VS-15.1)
Frequency: Daily / transaction-level
Volume: ~200–500 invoices/month (peak construction season)
Owner: AP Manager
Participants: AP Manager, Vendor, Treasury Manager
Source: workflow W3386 — Sliding-Scale Early-Payment Offer Generation &amp; Vendor Acceptance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3386_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3386_Lane1" name="AP Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3386_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3386_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3386_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3386_Lane2" name="Vendor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3386_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3386_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3386_Start4" name="Invoice approval (links to VS-15.1)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3386_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3386_Task5" name="AP/Platform auto-generate the sliding-scale early-payment offer on each…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: AP/Platform auto-generate the sliding-scale early-payment offer on each approved, enrolled invoice: discount % for each early-payment date derived from the curve (W3385); present to vendor via the supplier portal (links to VS-03.4) with net amount, discount, and effective date
Responsible (R): AP Manager / Platform
Accountable (A): AP Manager
Duration: Per invoice</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3386_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3386_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3386_Task6" name="Vendor reviews and accepts an offer (selects payment date) or declines (pays at…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Vendor reviews and accepts an offer (selects payment date) or declines (pays at standard term); system captures acceptance, locks the discount and payment date, and removes the payable from the standard payment run (links to VS-15.2)
Responsible (R): Vendor / AP Manager
Accountable (A): AP Manager
Duration: Per invoice</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3386_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3386_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3386_Task7" name="AP/Treasury monitor offer-to-acceptance conversion, yield capture, and vendor…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: AP/Treasury monitor offer-to-acceptance conversion, yield capture, and vendor participation; flag low-adoption vendors for Procurement outreach (W3385) and tune the curve based on analytics (W3388)
Responsible (R): AP Manager / Treasury Manager
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: Weekly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3386_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3386_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3386_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3386_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-545 (ensure controlled execution — Dynamic Discounting &amp; Early-Payment Operations (PA-105.2).) | - operational: vendor outreach and curve tuning (W3388); operational: offer-threshold and throttling (W3389)
Owner: AP Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3386_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3386_Annotation9" targetRef="W3386_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3386_Flow11" sourceRef="W3386_Start4" targetRef="W3386_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3386_Flow12" sourceRef="W3386_Task5" targetRef="W3386_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3386_Flow13" sourceRef="W3386_Task6" targetRef="W3386_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3386_Flow14" sourceRef="W3386_Task7" targetRef="W3386_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3386_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W3386_plane" bpmnElement="W_W3386">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3386_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W3386_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3386_Lane2_di" bpmnElement="W3386_Lane2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="250" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3386_Task5_di" bpmnElement="W3386_Task5"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3386_Task6_di" bpmnElement="W3386_Task6"><dc:Bounds x="610" y="295" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3386_Task7_di" bpmnElement="W3386_Task7"><dc:Bounds x="820" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3386_Start4_di" bpmnElement="W3386_Start4"><dc:Bounds x="290" y="147" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3386_End8_di" bpmnElement="W3386_End8"><dc:Bounds x="1050" y="317" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3386_Annotation9_di" bpmnElement="W3386_Annotation9"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="460" width="360" height="72" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3386_Flow11_di" bpmnElement="W3386_Flow11"><di:waypoint x="326" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="400" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3386_Flow12_di" bpmnElement="W3386_Flow12"><di:waypoint x="580" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="610" y="335" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3386_Flow13_di" bpmnElement="W3386_Flow13"><di:waypoint x="790" y="335" /><di:waypoint x="820" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3386_Flow14_di" bpmnElement="W3386_Flow14"><di:waypoint x="1000" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="1050" y="335" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3386_Assoc10_di" bpmnElement="W3386_Assoc10"><di:waypoint x="340" y="460" /><di:waypoint x="308" y="183" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3387" name="W3387. Self-Funded Early-Payment Execution, Funding &amp; Bank Settlement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Vendor offer acceptance (W3386); scheduled early-payment date
Frequency: Daily
Volume: ~150–400 early payments/month (peak)
Owner: AP Manager
Participants: AP Manager, Treasury Manager, Bank (links to VS-18.2), Vendor
Source: workflow W3387 — Self-Funded Early-Payment Execution, Funding &amp; Bank Settlement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3387_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3387_Lane1" name="AP Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3387_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3387_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3387_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3387_Lane2" name="Treasury Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3387_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3387_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3387_Start4" name="Vendor offer acceptance (W3386); scheduled early-payment date">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3387_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3387_Task5" name="AP/Platform compile the daily early-payment batch: accepted offers due today…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: AP/Platform compile the daily early-payment batch: accepted offers due today, net amount (face − discount), vendor bank routing, and entity/bank account (multi-entity per VS-72); validate cash availability with Treasury (W3389)
Responsible (R): AP Manager / Treasury Manager
Accountable (A): AP Manager
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3387_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3387_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3387_Task6" name="Treasury confirm funding source (operating account vs sweep per VS-18.2/W323)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Treasury confirm funding source (operating account vs sweep per VS-18.2/W323) and release the payment file; bank executes the early payment to the vendor; AP/Platform records the discount-captured income and clears the payable
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager / AP Manager
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3387_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3387_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3387_Task7" name="AP/Treasury reconcile the early-payment settlement to the bank statement (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: AP/Treasury reconcile the early-payment settlement to the bank statement (links to VS-18.2), confirm discount-income posting (links to VS-17.1), and resolve exceptions (W3383); report daily discount capture to Treasury
Responsible (R): AP Manager / Treasury Manager
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3387_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3387_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3387_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3387_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-106 (ensure SCF settlement &amp; covenant compliance.) | - operational: cash-availability validation (W3389); operational: payable-flag removal and reconciliation (W3392)
Owner: AP Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3387_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3387_Annotation9" targetRef="W3387_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3387_Flow11" sourceRef="W3387_Start4" targetRef="W3387_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3387_Flow12" sourceRef="W3387_Task5" targetRef="W3387_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3387_Flow13" sourceRef="W3387_Task6" targetRef="W3387_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3387_Flow14" sourceRef="W3387_Task7" targetRef="W3387_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3387_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W3387_plane" bpmnElement="W_W3387">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3387_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W3387_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3387_Lane2_di" bpmnElement="W3387_Lane2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="250" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3387_Task5_di" bpmnElement="W3387_Task5"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3387_Task6_di" bpmnElement="W3387_Task6"><dc:Bounds x="610" y="295" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3387_Task7_di" bpmnElement="W3387_Task7"><dc:Bounds x="820" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3387_Start4_di" bpmnElement="W3387_Start4"><dc:Bounds x="290" y="147" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3387_End8_di" bpmnElement="W3387_End8"><dc:Bounds x="1050" y="317" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3387_Annotation9_di" bpmnElement="W3387_Annotation9"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="460" width="360" height="72" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3387_Flow11_di" bpmnElement="W3387_Flow11"><di:waypoint x="326" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="400" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3387_Flow12_di" bpmnElement="W3387_Flow12"><di:waypoint x="580" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="610" y="335" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3387_Flow13_di" bpmnElement="W3387_Flow13"><di:waypoint x="790" y="335" /><di:waypoint x="820" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3387_Flow14_di" bpmnElement="W3387_Flow14"><di:waypoint x="1000" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="1050" y="335" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3387_Assoc10_di" bpmnElement="W3387_Assoc10"><di:waypoint x="340" y="460" /><di:waypoint x="308" y="183" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3388" name="W3388. Annual-Percentage-Rate (APR) / Discount-Yield Monitoring &amp; Optimization" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Weekly/monthly yield review; annual curve refresh (W3385)
Frequency: Weekly + monthly
Volume: Full dynamic-discounting portfolio
Owner: Treasury Manager
Participants: Treasury Manager, FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4), Procurement
Source: workflow W3388 — Annual-Percentage-Rate (APR) / Discount-Yield Monitoring &amp; Optimization</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3388_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3388_Lane1" name="Treasury Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3388_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3388_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3388_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3388_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3388_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3388_Start3" name="Weekly/monthly yield review; annual curve refresh (W3385)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3388_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3388_Task4" name="Treasury/Analytics compute the effective APR/yield of captured discounts…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Treasury/Analytics compute the effective APR/yield of captured discounts (discount $ ÷ face ÷ days-early × 365) by vendor, segment, and curve-band; benchmark against BuildRight&#x27;s cost of funds (links to VS-18.3/W319) and short-term investment yield (links to W318) to confirm discounting beats the alternative
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: Weekly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3388_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3388_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3388_Task5" name="Treasury/Procurement identify yield leakage (low-yield acceptances, curve…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Treasury/Procurement identify yield leakage (low-yield acceptances, curve over-payment, concentration) and high-yield opportunities (untapped vendors, curve tightening); recommend curve/vendor changes and rebalance enrollment
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager / Procurement
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3388_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3388_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3388_Task6" name="Treasury Manager present yield analytics and recommendations to the SCF…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Treasury Manager present yield analytics and recommendations to the SCF governance review (W3384) and feed outcomes to the working-capital dashboard (W3399); update the curve per W3385 as needed
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3388_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3388_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3388_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3388_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-106 (ensure SCF settlement &amp; covenant compliance.) | - operational: APR monitoring and curve calibration; operational: granular analytics
Owner: Treasury Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
