    <bpmn:process id="W_W3391" name="W3391. Multi-Entity / Intercompany Payable Discount Coordination" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Multi-entity AP (Depot, Logistics, Digital Commerce entities per profile §2); intercompany vendor invoicing
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: 5 legal entities; shared vendor base
Owner: Treasury Manager
Participants: Treasury Manager, AP (per entity), Intercompany/Shared Services (links to VS-72), Vendor
Source: workflow W3391 — Multi-Entity / Intercompany Payable Discount Coordination</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3391_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3391_Lane1" name="Treasury Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3391_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3391_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3391_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3391_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3391_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3391_Start3" name="Multi-entity AP (Depot, Logistics, Digital Commerce entities per profile §2)…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3391_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3391_Task4" name="Treasury/AP coordinate SCF/dynamic-discounting across the 5 entities: vendor…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Treasury/AP coordinate SCF/dynamic-discounting across the 5 entities: vendor enrollment maps to multiple entity payables, facility limit/curve apply group-wide, and each entity&#x27;s payables feed the platform; reconcile to entity AP sub-ledgers
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager / AP (per entity)
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3391_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3391_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3391_Task5" name="Treasury/Shared Services handle intercompany vendor invoicing (e.g., Logistics…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Treasury/Shared Services handle intercompany vendor invoicing (e.g., Logistics entity charges Depot entity per profile §2): ensure discount eligibility, payment term, and SCF treatment are consistent and that intercompany elimination (links to VS-17.2/W234) is unaffected by early-payment timing
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager / Shared Services
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3391_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3391_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3391_Task6" name="Treasury allocate finance cost/discount income to the correct entity per…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Treasury allocate finance cost/discount income to the correct entity per transfer-pricing policy (links to VS-17.2/W235/VS-72), reconcile entity-level cash impact to the cash forecast (links to VS-18.1), and report group-wide working-capital outcome (W3393)
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3391_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3391_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3391_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
