        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-545 (ensure controlled execution — Dynamic Discounting &amp; Early-Payment Operations (PA-105.2).) | - operational: entity-aware platform config and reconciliation; operational: exclusion rules and coordination
Owner: Treasury Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
